v0.1.1 — the wallet gets its name

btc-swift becomes Winnow, end to end: package, app target, environment, P2P
user agent, and winnowwallet.com on Cloudflare Pages with the e2e screenshots
carrying the page instead of marketing copy.

Under the rename, mainnet first-contact readiness: peer dials race in
parallel instead of queueing, the bundled fallback peers are live-verified
filter-serving nodes, and sync progress is visible while it happens.
